        },
        {
          "text": "“I nino dwe apar wie abic, me dwe me abiro, ibino wunu bedo kede cokere acil; kur iti wunu iye ticcoro atek. Ibino wunu kwero ecuban a Rwot pi nino abiro, ",
          "type": "text",
