              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibino miyo wunu karacel i moko kwon apwottere ame orubo kede moo jeituni ame romo gwata adek pi twon acel acel, gwata aryo pi nyok romo acel acel, ",
